{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5fbdf4b4a5839285d9be728dcf3852a58c4568aa01bcbe9036f940458c13a9b9", "ja": "（今日は、紗代子の宣材写真撮影だ。\n初めての撮影だけど、緊張してないかな？）", "zh": "（今天要拍纱代子的宣传照。\n她是第一次参加拍摄，会不会紧张呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "a7ecd147392a2b41c691fd46b4ece8a0553812bf8673350fcaed41bb761c2c82", "ja": "こんな立派なスタジオで、撮影してもらえるなんて\n……まだ、信じられません。", "zh": "没想到能在这么棒的摄影棚让专家拍照\n……我到现在还是不敢相信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "ec8ecdc44dc4eead47f240b4b3a286d403c8fdfde8d138be682204f8ea263846", "ja": "でも、緊張している場合じゃありませんね。\nお仕事がたくさん取れるように、頑張らないと！", "zh": "但现在不是紧张的时候呢。\n为了接到很多工作，我要好好加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "710bf001116b5db91db25b565ccd18bd8dd72a878d2edc76b5973ccd12f7e820", "ja": "ずいぶん気合いが入ってるみたいだけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "你似乎很有干劲，拍摄没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "495020746e9e1f27955637b13da22da097815ad8d344b97c077d1fae2d2c882c", "ja": "はい！\n家で何度も予習してきたので、問題ありません。", "zh": "是的！\n我在家里预习过很多次了，没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "00e63bda9c343a82de9bb9c2781d106cad62120bb9b65b149664cafab74841b8", "ja": "アイドルはどんなポーズや表情をするのか、\n雑誌やテレビを見て、研究してきましたから！", "zh": "我有看杂志和电视，\n研究过偶像会摆的姿势跟表情了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c1ec44bec7c1977d991cf93ae709554feb6ad3632a5713817ae517b05fa0ff1b", "ja": "そうか。まあ、あまり考えすぎないことも大事だから。\n楽しんでいこう！", "zh": "这样啊。不过，别想太多也很重要。\n开心地完成拍摄吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "288c45af87ebebcbb347357c57d13030fed55b9f6ba55ce12b9ccbc2b6223c76", "ja": "はい！　……あ、そろそろ撮影が始まりますね。\nそれでは{$P$}、行ってきます！", "zh": "好的！啊……差不多要开始拍照了。\n那{$P$}，我走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1008_camman", "source_sha256": "8cace5d7c60745ddf76a17c9b0a5483c3c9cf94244435e0aca48dba16df4aba2", "ja": "ちょっと表情が硬いですね……。\nもう少し、肩の力を抜いてもらえますか？", "zh": "你的表情有点僵硬呢……\n可以再放松一点吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "0ebb545b654e762bfa2e78d2c6e53f812d12453a3578a936b86b56376b202ade", "ja": "えっ？\nこ、こうですか？", "zh": "咦？\n这、这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "8a2243477645c385013717015005087e90e90b5cd3b484f1bdef027c39b6d83f", "ja": "うふ、うふふふふ……。", "zh": "呵呵、唔呵呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e334b9b29813dc951a156122cff0df9f3a4fd78c80e3ff435bf20591d2494af2", "ja": "（笑顔がぎこちない……カメラマンさんの言うように、\n気負いすぎて、肩の力が入ってるみたいだ）", "zh": "（笑容好僵硬……就像摄影师说的，\n她似乎太逞强了，非常僵硬。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "33f45801e56fa84fa8da36200cd4b21e67242e13861454efa04846b1e669d584", "ja": "すみません、少し休憩をください！\n紗代子、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "不好意思，请让她休息一下！\n纱代子，可以借一步说话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "b04d788649b6bbbc200a025625111d47be7a7d99f299b5dd6243349f6655931d", "ja": "す、すみません。私がうまくできないせいで、\nカメラマンさんやスタッフさんに、ご迷惑を……。", "zh": "对、对不起。都是因为我做不好，\n给摄影师和工作人员添麻烦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1014_p", "source_sha256": "23529061641b827fb3b7e83cc89b78f36610b688dc6654f12556a28d78ab06f1", "ja": "初めての撮影なんだから、それは気にしなくていいよ。", "zh": "毕竟你是第一次拍照，不用在意这个啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "a45cb8b9d92f8850732e553b9b384bc355cbc86439f5057caf02fa57196e3d7c", "ja": "でも……。", "zh": "但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "df098c1dbf70280124fc443546d9df9ef21ce9b3e258258ca22f136b84f9b887", "ja": "それより、無理にアイドルらしい表情を作らないで、\nいつもの笑顔はできないか？", "zh": "比起这个，你能别勉强自己摆出偶像会摆的表情，\n改成露出平时的笑容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "c728aa25d538a92e1ebb9a0ff241794c21bf5a03bec676c2debc5397ad5cea49", "ja": "えっ？　い、いつもの私でいいんですか？\nでも、アイドルの宣材写真なのに……。", "zh": "咦？平、平时的我就可以了吗？\n可是这是偶像的宣传照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cb7396d1799d79c362f10409a3ba1f39e8d40bf7fc32e8c6fc9cb79e91b07d6b", "ja": "これは紗代子の宣材写真なんだ。\nだから、紗代子らしさが出せたほうがいい写真になる。", "zh": "我们是要拍纱代子的宣传照。\n所以要展现出纱代子的特质，才算是好照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3fd445319449595eb49da07fd5da6ce7d832ce1daebd9df3f03782fd9f84793b", "ja": "紗代子は自然に笑っている時のほうが、\nかわいいと思うんだけど。", "zh": "而且我也觉得纱代子自然笑着时比较可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "f6b93e1be1ba2521523fa4c05be5cf6291a75327e0f2239a9aa57703b62341f5", "ja": "えっ……！", "zh": "咦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "0cf211fc227c3669a68535d3d9149408283f8e7f7090b2ddbf62944b284768ce", "ja": "え、えっと……\nそんなこと、初めて言われました……。", "zh": "呃，那个……\n我是第一次被人这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1023_p", "source_sha256": "86a884d845e0749f9be08a91886e5a839db0d2791096d0cb8ade09a90e6e6bd1", "ja": "あっ！　そう、その笑顔だよ。\n今みたいに、自然な感じでいけばいい。", "zh": "啊！对，就是那张笑脸。\n只要像刚才那样自然地笑就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "32a92cb16f5689281f472bf1bd05d4d1b0a7bee2db48ccc50ce40baaaea8696e", "ja": "あっ……い、今の感じですね！\nわかりました！", "zh": "啊……刚、刚才那种感觉是吗！\n我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "c76173b01af251f201a5d8f346a51c64081ef5708cfa56ad1f36b05b1ca0d1f6", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます！\n私らしく、撮ってもらってきます！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你的建议！\n我会去拍出自己的风格的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1026_p", "source_sha256": "258bea9e487c31730a67032426cedb66a61e3361a4dc95119b51817180761ad8", "ja": "うん、その調子だ。\n行ってこい！", "zh": "嗯，就是这种感觉。\n快去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1028_p", "source_sha256": "12aa0e9397f82547376a8ca79b52eac9c11e9df65500753ddece9a97bafceae1", "ja": "（その後も少し堅くなることはあったが……リラックス\nするよう声を掛けては持ち直し、撮影は無事終了した）", "zh": "（那之后，虽然有时还是略为僵硬……\n但提醒她放松也都能改善，最后顺利完成拍摄了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_002_1029_p", "source_sha256": "1f571112d0f6e70703897ea440f1743f6b437acfcc9afb13716269fadc2894dc", "ja": "（熱意がある方がいいとは限らない。\n紗代子には、もっとアイドルを楽しんでもらおう）", "zh": "（只顾着投入热情不见得是件好事，\n我要让纱代子更享受当偶像的感觉。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
